        "TileImage": "$($repository ee3f55b8-12f8-4245-8ef2-3022b4f6f120).Image",
        "Description": "Afternoon. 47.\rOur client is the large music label Contract Records. It seems that they have evidence that members of The Class have damaged our client&apos;s business in various ways. Jordan Cross killed their up-coming pop star Hannah Highmoore. Heidi Santoro is blackmailing in exchange for a new record deal. Abel quit a band under their label to join The Class. Wes Liston was hired to master an album and he sucked. And Dexy Barat is just an all-around bitch, apparently. No reuinion tour for them.",
